Well, fast fact number one.

55
00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:03.110
Now, I mentioned that this episode was written by Paul and directed by Paul, but this was

56
00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:06.910
actually the first episode directed by Paul Lieberstein.

57
00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:09.330
Ah, yeah.

58
00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:14.430
So he will go on to direct many more, but this was his office directorial debut.

59
00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:15.670
Oh, gee.

60
00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:16.850
Yeah.

61
00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.590
So I reached out to him because I was like, I mean, he wrote it.

62
00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:22.310
He directed it.

63
00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.310
Let's hear from him.

64
00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:23.690
Yeah.

65
00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:29.050
And he told me that he wrote this episode while he was on vacation in Russia.

66
00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:30.350
What?

67
00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:30.970
Yeah.

68
00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.370
