00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.170
Oh, my gosh.

213
00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.150
You have to read it.

214
00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:31.970
You have to read it.

215
00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:32.210
Okay.

216
00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:36.210
It says, I have to warn people about the proprietor of Shroot FarMs.

217
00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:40.550
He may portray himself as a gentleman farmer, but he is not what he seeMs.

218
00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.630
He killed my cat, Sprinkles.

